WEBVTT

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:22.880
<i>Just a little while in the past,</i>

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:26.630
<i>or maybe, a short while in the future...</i>

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.200
<i>A terrible war was taking place at sea</i>

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.760
<i>between strange enemies called "Abyssals" 
that came from beneath the waves,</i>

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:43.000
<i>and the ones that opposed 
them, the Fleet Girls,</i>

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:47.230
<i>within whom dwelled the souls of ships.</i>

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:55.230
<i>At first, it seemed as though the Fleet Girls 
would claim an easy victory.</i>

00:00:56.620 --> 00:01:00.580
<i>But the enemy came in unstoppable numbers.</i>

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:04.780
<i>The girls were wounded, and fell.</i>

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:07.380
<i>The tide of battle turned against them.</i>

00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:09.640
<i>And then...</i>

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:16.750
Shigure, thanks. You must be exhausted.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.060
We should be safe this far 
from the enemy.

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:22.560
Yeah. But I...

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:29.690
Enemy planes?! North-northwest!

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:32.950
Preparing for AA combat!

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:37.250
Ryuuhou, current speed at 18 knots! 
Engine damaged! Turning starboard!

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:38.090
Shigure!

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.160
Shigure, engines to full.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.340
Please hit!

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:53.320
Confirmed kill.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.470
Loading next round.

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.720
Machine guns, open fire!

00:01:57.720 --> 00:01:59.100
Two more to the rear?

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:03.520
One down!

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:05.390
The rear two are getting closer!

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:07.440
Damn it!

00:02:08.590 --> 00:02:09.570
They made it past me?

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:10.640
Ryuuhou!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:17.950
Go down, damn it!

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:21.560
Wait! Don't go!

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:29.960
Okay, next is...

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:53.050
<b>See You Again on Another Quiet Blue Sea</b>

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:28.910
<b>Sortie Day</b>

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.890
<b>E16A Zuiun 
Type-16 Two Seat 
Reconnaissance 
Seaplane</b>

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.890
<b>Operating
 Manual</b>

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.890
<b><b>Approved by the Bureau of 
Fleet Girl Education</b></b>

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.020
Bye.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:41.940
<b>Sasebo Naval District</b>

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:55.290
It never... lasts forever.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:57.600
It never does.

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:02.090
Yes, come in.

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:06.110
Shigure, you're still in your room?

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:11.860
Sorry, Hamakaze. Does Torpedo 
Squadron 2 have a meeting?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:17.380
No, they're reorganizing the fleet. 
A new order of battle was announced.

00:07:17.380 --> 00:07:18.370
And...

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.160
Oh, okay.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.870
Who am I with this time?

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:25.790
Shigure, you're...

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:29.130
Hamakaze, thanks.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.790
I'll go see for myself.

