00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:32.400
<i>I'm with...</i>

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:35.570
<i>1st Striking Force, 3rd Section.</i>

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:43.900
<b><b>1st Striking Force 1st Section (1YB1H)
</b>BATDIV 1: Battleships Yamato, Musashi, Nagato
 CRUDIV 4: Heavy Cruisers Atago, Takao, Maya, Choukai
